    "report": "projects/ai-agents--agencycli.md",
    "screening_excerpt": "One CLI + built-in web console. Agents that plan, execute, and talk to each other — while you sleep. agencycli** is a lightweight CLI for building and operating teams of AI agents. You define the org chart once — teams, roles, projects, skills — and agents assemble their own context, pick up tasks, and run autonomously on a heartbeat schedule."
