    "report": "projects/ai-agents--agent-zero.md",
    "screening_excerpt": "Agent Zero is an open agent framework for work that needs more than chat: a Dockerized Linux desktop, a browser with DOM annotation, live document cowork, projects, skills, plugins, and a bridge back to your host machine. The desktop **A0 Launcher** is the fastest guided path on a personal machine. Download it, open it, and let it check Docker, create Instances, manage ports, and connect to local or remote Agent Zero installs."
  },
