    "screening_excerpt": "BleedingADE is a project-first control plane for coding agents: the best parts of T3 Code, AgentBox, Herdr, Beads, and selected agent runtimes, combined without exposing terminal/session-manager chaos as the product model. No production implementation yet. This repository is first resolving the product job, domain model, execution topology, session continuity, event fabric, runtime boundaries, web/mobile information architecture, and minimum coherent release."
  },
