    "report": "projects/ai-agents--collab-public.md",
    "screening_excerpt": "Collaborator is an end-to-end environment for agentic development. Terminals, context files, and running code — all arranged on an infinite canvas in one place. No context switching, no tab hunting. Just your agents and your work, side by side. The app is early-stage and in active development, with native desktop targets for macOS, Windows, and Linux. On Windows, terminal sessions can target both PowerShell and WSL2 distros."
