    "report": "projects/ai-agents--electric.md",
    "screening_excerpt": "Sync is the magic ingredient behind fast, modern software. From apps like Figma and Linear to AI agents running on live local data. Electric is a Postgres sync engine. It solves the hard problems of sync for you, including partial replication, fan-out, and data delivery. So you can build awesome software, without rolling your own sync."
  },
