    "report": "projects/ai-agents--harnessrouter.md",
    "screening_excerpt": "Build agent products without handling harness engineering.** HarnessRouter is the infrastructure layer that turns existing harnesses like Codex and Claude Code into plug-and-play agent backends, letting your product run tasks, retrieve results, and switch harnesses through one API. HarnessRouter implements the Unified Harness Protocol (UHP) and provides an OpenAI Responses-compatible API, handling persistent sessions, streaming progress, files, artifacts, cancellation, and structured failures."
  },
