    "screening_excerpt": "🐈 **nanobot** is an ultra-lightweight, open-source, self-hosted personal AI agent framework written in Python. It runs in a WebUI, terminal, or chat apps and combines tools, long-term memory, MCP integrations, model routing, multi-agent delegation, scheduled automation, and an OpenAI-compatible API in a small, readable core. - connect to Telegram, Discord, Slack, WeChat, Email, Mattermost, Linear, and other channels"
  },
  {
