    "screening_excerpt": "OpenHarness** delivers core lightweight agent infrastructure: tool-use, skills, memory, and multi-agent coordination. ohmo** is a personal AI agent built on OpenHarness — not another chatbot, but an assistant that actually works for you over long sessions. Chat with ohmo in Feishu / Slack / Telegram / Discord, and it forks branches, writes code, runs tests, and opens PRs on its own. ohmo runs on your existing Claude Code or Codex subscription — no extra API key needed."
  },
