    "report": "projects/ai-agents--terminal-bench.md",
    "screening_excerpt": "Terminal-Bench is a benchmark designed to measure the frontier of agent work with a diverse, difficult, high quality set of tasks that evolve over time. All frontier agent builders use Terminal-Bench to track progress and compare capabilities. Terminal-Bench is a continuous benchmark, with tagged releases published on the Harbor Hub. Open an issue to report any task bugs and open a PR for task improvements or new tasks. Our roadmap is publicly visible."
  },
