    "report": "projects/ai-agents--wayland-core.md",
    "screening_excerpt": "Most AI tools are as good as they'll ever be the day you install them. Wayland Core isn't — it convenes a council of rival models on your hardest problems, fuses their best answer into one, and rewrites and re-scores its own skill prompts against an eval harness, keeping only what wins. Terminal-first, on your keys, in Rust. Terminal-first · Multi-provider · Self-evolving · MCP-native · Embeddable · Apache-2.0"
  },
