    "report": "projects/ai-agents-mem--mcp-memory-graphdb.md",
    "screening_excerpt": "A persistent graph-database memory server for Claude and other LLM agents, built on the Model Context Protocol (MCP) and powered by DuckDB. Unlike flat key-value memory stores, mcp-memory-graphdb lets an AI agent remember people, projects, concepts and the *relationships* between them — as a real graph, stored locally in a single file, with a schema you control and can evolve safely over time."
  },
