    "report": "projects/ai-agents-mem--tracedecay.md",
    "screening_excerpt": "TraceDecay builds a local semantic graph of your repository so AI coding agents can ask for the right symbols, call relationships, impact radius, docs, and source snippets without scanning the tree. Instead of repeated `grep`, `glob`, and file reads, agents use MCP tools such as `tracedecay_context`, `tracedecay_search`, `tracedecay_callers`, and `tracedecay_impact`."
  },
