    "screening_excerpt": "Anex lets you run GPU workloads on cheap cloud GPU providers (like VastAI) while managing them through your existing Kubernetes cluster. You write standard Kubernetes manifests, and Anex takes care of renting machines, setting up networking, and making your remote GPU pods feel like they're part of your cluster. - A **container registry** you can push to (Docker Hub, AWS ECR, GitHub Container Registry, etc.)"
  },
