    "screening_excerpt": "(https://github.com/xxyyue/llm-observer-proxy-go/actions/workflows/ci.yml) LLM Observer Proxy runs an embedded Bifrost data plane for each evaluation or agent run and stores its observable LLM traffic under a stable `run_id`. The observer records requests, responses, streaming output, tool calls, token usage, cost estimates, errors, and provider-visible reasoning content. It does not require Python, LiteLLM, Docker, or a separate Bifrost process."
  },
