    "screening_excerpt": "Self-hosted AI agent swarm and workflow orchestration platform — your cluster, your machines, your agents, your code. Optio runs AI agents as durable, observable, triggerable **sessions** — on Kubernetes pods you operate or on the laptops your team already has — and wires them together into workflows and swarms. It began as a ticket-to-merged-PR pipeline, and it still does that end to end. But the same control plane now runs scheduled reports, webhook responders, event-driven automations on your own machine, interactive agent terminals you can "
  },
