    ],
    "report": "projects/ai-eval--frontier-harness-eval.md",
    "screening_excerpt": "We ran the same **Kimi K3** model through nine coding-agent harnesses—12 configurations in total—on the same 30 software-engineering tasks. With the model, tasks, and runtime held constant, changing the harness changed pass rate, cost, cache behavior, and speed. The interactive report includes failed runs, total cost per task, cache behavior, speed, and task-level results. For the evaluation design and analysis, read the launch article."
  },
