    "report": "projects/ai-gen--open-design.md",
    "screening_excerpt": "✨ **Introducing OpenDesign Go**. The Go Plan starts at $8 for your first month, with monthly credits for over 10 models, including GPT-6.1 Sol, GPT-6 Luna, DeepSeek V4.1 Flash, GLM-5.3 Flash-X, and MiMo V2.6 Flash. All personal plans include API access for Codex, Claude Code, DSH, OpenCode, and more. 🧩 **DeepSeek Harness is now supported.** Connect DeepSeek's official `dsh` agent harness to OpenDesign as a native runtime, with structured thinking, tool calls, model discovery, cancellation, and session resume. Generated files stay in the OpenDes"
