    "report": "projects/ai-info--hermes-agent-orange-book.md",
    "screening_excerpt": "A hands-on guide to Hermes Agent, the open-source AI Agent framework by Nous Research — the first agent that ships with its \"reins\" built in, and the reins grow themselves. This is a from-scratch rewrite.** The first edition was based on Hermes v0.7.0. Two months and nine releases later, the product had grown a whole new face — a native desktop app, a full browser dashboard, 23 messaging platforms — so the book is rebuilt around v0.16.0 (\"The Surface Release\")."
  },
  {
