    "topics": [
      "memory",
      "import-generation",
      "decisions"
    ],
    "report": "projects/ai-query--fastmcp.md",
    "screening_excerpt": "A TypeScript framework for building MCP servers capable of handling client sessions. FastMCP implements the legacy, handshake-based MCP revisions (`2025-11-25` and earlier). It does not support the current specification, `2026-07-28`, which made the protocol stateless — no `initialize` handshake and no `Mcp-Session-Id`. For a framework targeting the current spec, use ViteMCP."
  },
  {
