    "report": "projects/ai-query--kanban-code.md",
    "screening_excerpt": "Native on macOS (SwiftUI liquid glass) and Windows (Tauri). The IDE for 2026. A native macOS app for running multiple Claude Code agents in parallel. Each task is a card on a Kanban board that automatically links your Claude session, git worktree, tmux terminals, and GitHub PR together — cards flow from backlog to done as Claude works, opens PRs, and gets them merged. Push notifications on your phone when agents need attention, remote execution to offload work to a server, and sleep prevention to keep your Mac awake while agents run."
  },
