    "report": "projects/ai-spec--design.md.md",
    "screening_excerpt": "A format specification for describing a visual identity to coding agents. DESIGN.md gives agents a persistent, structured understanding of a design system. A DESIGN.md file combines machine-readable design tokens (YAML front matter) with human-readable design rationale (markdown prose). Tokens give agents exact values. Prose tells them *why* those values exist and how to apply them."
  },
